  "notes": "One complete canonical seated drawing sampled through a continuous C1 vertical breathing map. Head and shoulders rise 3.8 px; chest smoothly stretches toward fixed hips. Rows y535 onward are byte-identical, preserving hands, knees, seat and shoes. No separated body layers or neck/waist cuts. 70 frames at 40 ms form a seamless 2800 ms breath. The old weak chest-only breathing is replaced, not layered twice. Scale v6: one fixed whole-character transform per clip, matched to the standing-idle median opaque head silhouette area. It includes eyes/mouth, so blinking does not change the scale estimate. No frame-specific scaling, head/body cuts, or pose-height normalization. Grounded contacts remain y592; flight clearance is transformed about the shared root. Pose projection, breathing and original drawing proportions remain intact.",
  "source": "animations/23-toy-garden-lu-seat-idle/spritesheet-optimized-v1.png"
